-    a communication from A. Shepard, President and Vice-Chancellor, Western University;

-    a communication from K. Morrison, Executive Director, Old East Village BIA; and

-    a communication from K. Nielsen, Board Chair and V. Smith, Interim Executive Director, Downtown London; it being further noted that the Strategic Priorities and Pol […motion text truncated]

